    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Lara Pleasence",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117778499910393347740/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVmCqxVKTlJnb1kWZ6f72daMkJo3iyWTSgFuYwS-YOYTc3ejRNeBw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Amazing! Professional and kind. Kyle and Justin went above and beyond while working on our complicated foundation issues. Matthew listened to all of our concerns and really broke down our quote so that we knew exactly where our money was going. Could not recommend this company enough!!!!",
        "time": 1759346821,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Colin Rollinson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110807589257075488215/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKNXchkiz_dqjJMJIKPNmKKsWzyJ_wvVCTrs0SOKz4TXANcJuoY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Matt and his team were a pleasure to work with. I was given a quote in 24 hours, got my appointment quickly (even if we had to reschedule because my street was inaccessible for a few days). The super friendly team was in and out in 45 minutes to repair a crack which went all the way to the footing. Can't recommend them enough.",
        "time": 1765728502,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Daniel Saykaly",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112577152189073893009/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLwjIsUDd7MKBhiAvRQi5T1DWVoJGoddwUdKmk3W61XzWHEIQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Excellent!  Solange Solide did a great job of redoing our garage floor.  Quality work and prompt service. The team works professionally and their boss Matthew is reliable, friendly, and very focused on client satisfaction. Highly recommended.",
        "time": 1753459505,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Carole Canaan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106956868305561544411/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUoFI-mmV-hbvsGT3IFEA5uXZgXrtXwWfgehCzSlyUeNw8nTohV8w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I highly recommend Solage Solide. I had my parging and window well done by their teams and they were wonderful to work with. Thank you for the professional service you provided!",
        "time": 1755889318,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nadia Hanine",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105616338642276817148/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwRzfEh9WjnYzCimnS_eFV7uCiPiQwny56XY5UPGXXeRtduOk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We recently had the pleasure of hiring Solage Solide to install a French drain system around our house, and we must say, we are thoroughly impressed. From start to finish, the experience was nothing short of exceptional. First and foremost, the customer service provided was exemplary. From the initial consultation to the completion of the project, they were attentive, professional, and truly invested in meeting our needs. They very patiently listened to all of our concerns, thoroughly assessed all of the issues around our property, and provided clear explanations of the proposed solution.\n\nWhen it came to the actual installation, they demonstrated remarkable efficiency and expertise. Their attention to detail was remarkable throughout the process, ensuring that every aspect of the French drain system was installed correctly and efficiently. What truly sets them apart is their commitment to using high-quality materials. There is literally no chance that any drop of water comes in our house from the foundation.\n\nIt was truly remarkable that Matthew personally oversaw our project from start to finish. He also made it a point to visit the site every day to monitor the progress of the work. This level of dedication and hands-on involvement from Matthew speaks volumes about the company's commitment to excellence and customer satisfaction.",
        "time": 1713898357,
        "translated": false
      }
